	(text "Supplies (RP2350 datasheet 6.3.7): IOVDD, QSPI_IOVDD, USB_OTP_VDD, ADC_AVDD and VREG_VIN on +3V3_RP, the\nAP2112K LDO that rises with +5V; the core regulator switches VREG_LX through 3.3 uH onto DVDD (VREG_FB senses\nit), its analog supply VREG_AVDD through 33R / 4.7 uF.  A capacitor at every supply pin (QSPI_IOVDD and USB_OTP_VDD\nshare one, as in Raspberry Pi's minimal design), drawn at the pin it serves.\nRESET resets the RP2350A and the ESP32-S3 together (D2 steers RST_BTN onto RUN and S3_EN): the way back to\nthe FujiNet's CONFIG.  Hold BOOTSEL while pressing RESET for the RP's USB boot ROM; the S3 does both itself: IO4\n(RUN_CTL) low resets the RP, IO5 (BOOTSEL_CTL) low through that reset selects BOOTSEL.  USB: 27R at the RP, the S3\nis the host.  SWD and RUN on bring-up pads.  The W25Q16JV (2 MB, Pico 2-style boot2) on QSPI; its /CS is the strap."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 68.58 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0641846b-3ef4-5c04-838f-83482a819237")
	)
